meta {
  name: Get TMDB Person Films
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{API_URL}}/tmdb/person/287?kind=actor
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  kind: actor
}

docs {
  Get a person's full filmography from TMDB, marking the films already in the collection.

  Path Parameters:
  - tmdbPersonId: TMDB person ID - REQUIRED

  Query Parameters:
  - kind: actor or director - REQUIRED
    - actor: credited acting roles (roles marked "(uncredited)" are left out)
    - director: films where the person's job is Director

  Returns { data: [...] }, newest first with undated films last. Each film has:
  - tmdbId: TMDB movie ID
  - title: Film title
  - year: Release year, or null when TMDB has no date
  - character: Role played, joined with " / " for several roles; actors only, null when unknown
  - inCollection: Whether the film is already in the database

  Returns 400 for a missing or unknown kind and 404 when TMDB has no such person.
  Reads from TMDB and the database but saves nothing.

  Example Response:
  {
    "data": [
      {
        "tmdbId": "550",
        "title": "Fight Club",
        "year": 1999,
        "character": "Tyler Durden",
        "inCollection": true
      }
    ]
  }
}
